# Step 001 - Getting Started (Foundation)

The goal of this set of instructions is to ensure that your workstation is setup properly and that you are able to fully run/execute the starting-point of the application.  

This should take no more than 10 minutes to complete, and is the starting point for all things related to the project.

## Create New Project

- Create a 'src' folder within your target directory
- File -> "New Project"
- Select `.NET MAUI Blazor Hybrid App`
- Project Name `FieldOps.Mobile`
- Folder -> Select your `src` directory
- Check the "Place Solution and project in the same directory" box
- Select `Next`
- Select .NET 10 & leave the sample pages
- Click `Create`

## Validate Application Execution

Within Visual studio, you should now be able to run the application.

You can use the version selector, to pick your terget

