### Troubleshooting

Depending on your system configuration if you see an error message about supporting `ios` or `maccatalyst` the quick fix is to disable those targets, by commenting out this line of the `FieldOps.Mobile` project

```` xml
<TargetFrameworks Condition="!$([MSBuild]::IsOSPlatform('linux'))">$(TargetFrameworks);net10.0-ios;net10.0-maccatalyst</TargetFrameworks>
````

We will discuss this more in the training.

